OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for medical centre win
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a medical centre in
OL,7,FPeterborough with 26 treatment rooms
OL,8,Fand student accommodation have been
OL,9,Fapproved.
OL,11,FIt will be built on land at Silver Hill
OL,12,Fin the Hampton area of Peterborough.
OL,14,FThe planning application said the
OL,15,FHampton Medical Centre would provide
OL,16,Fclinical, training and research
OL,17,Ffacilities.
OL,19,FThe centre, next to the Serpentine
OL,20,FGreen shopping area, is expected to
OL,21,Fcreate about 40 jobs, as the
OL,22,FPeterborough Telegraph first reported.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
